SUMMARY:Giving Tree Lighting Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nMon\, Nov 23 (in place of rehearsal that night
 ) Arrive 4:30 at the Barnes and Noble entrance to the Asheville Mall to si
 ng at the Ingles Giving Tree event in support of Manna Food Bank. Sing for
  about an hour then maybe afterglow in the Food Court.\n\nJoin us as we li
 ght up the season of giving!\nCelebrate the Giving Tree Lighting Ceremony 
 and help us kick off the Annual Food Drive with Ingles and MANNA Food Bank
 .
